-align:center;\"><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-bottom:0.03in;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-top:0.03in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;padding-bottom:0.03in;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"\">&#160;&#160;&#160;5.a&#160;&#160;&#160;Dense<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-top:0.03in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;padding-bottom:0.03in;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">3 <\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-top:0.03in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;padding-bottom:0.03in;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">287 <\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-top:0.03in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"\">&#160;&#160;&#160;5.b&#160;&#160;&#160;Medium<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-top:0.03in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">1.5 <\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;padding-top:0.03in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">144 <\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">6.&#160;&#160;&#160;Nominally Unsatisfactory Bearing Materials:<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;Loose granular soils<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;Soft clay soils<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;Loose Silt<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;All organic silts, organic clays, peats, soft clays, granular soils and varved silts<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">See 1806.2.1<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">See 1806.2.1<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">7.&#160;&#160;&#160;Controlled and uncontrolled fills.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">See 1806.2.2 or 1806.2.3<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">See 1806.2.2 or 1806.2.3<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><tfoot><tr><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot><\/table><\/div><\/ScrollTable>",
